    "title": "ESPN host apologizes to coed for false story: 'I deeply regret the pain that was caused' - NewsBreak",
    "text": "ESPN host apologizes to coed for false story: ‘I deeply regret the pain that was caused’\nBy Mark Heim,\n2 hours agoPat McAfee made a public apology to Mary Kate Cornett, an Ole Miss student, for talking about and spreading a rumor about her. “I can now happily share with you that I recently got to meet Mary Kate and her family,” McAfee said. “And I got a chance to sincerely apologize to them and acknowledge that what I said about Mary Kate was based solely on what others were saying on the internet.”",
